  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Rural Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Components: training on agro ecological methods,  gender equality and social cohesion, awareness raising for behavioural changes. Expected results are that: the populations of the target areas of the project live in peace, tolerate each other in their cultural, religious and gender diversity. Women and men in the target areas programme have equal control and access to various technical trainings to work, finance and natural resources. The populations of the areas of intervention have agro ecological and resilient farming practices in the face of the effects of climate change. The food security of the populations in the areas of intervention has improved. The ecosystem is regenerated and the populations take responsibility for their environment.</narrative>
  </description>
